# Signing material. Nothing here is ever meant to be committed: the certificate
# lives in the login keychain and in the APPLE_CERT_P12 secret, the App Store
# Connect key in ~/private_keys and in APPLE_API_KEY_P8. A rule costs nothing and
# catches the one time somebody exports a .p12 into the repo to "just try it".
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
